// modem 2.1.0. The navigation builders return an effect that
// Lustre's runtime performs: it carries the navigation; a handler they take
// is charged where the builder is called.

covers 2.1.0
contract modem.advanced : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
contract modem.back : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
contract modem.forward : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
contract modem.init : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
reviewed modem.initial_uri
contract modem.load : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
contract modem.push : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]
contract modem.replace : [] where runs : [], carries : [Dom]

unreviewed modem.simulate : a test helper that drives a simulated application; not reviewed
